      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that there's no \"official\" proof but thats exactly the point isn't it?? if they're doing it covertly they wouldn't put it in the terms of service. plus the sensors required for the features they advertise are basically the same ones needed for gait analysis and biometric monitoring. don't you think it's suspicious how much detail they're able to pull from the app compared to what they actually tell us they're measuring?",
